scene B: Hard times are when ties count. {N} knows which regulars at the corner bar still have work to give out.
scene R: No money for a night out is no reason to stay in. {N} wants a party that costs nothing.
scene G: The family has cut the Sunday dinner to three dishes. {N} worries that {friend} will leave and not come back.
